# seaward snapshot 1
# The invented shop server after the fix. Docker now publishes the database, the cache and
# the admin page on this machine only (-p 127.0.0.1:PORT:PORT), and the ufw rule for a port
# nothing listens on is gone.
### meta
host shop-1
seaward 0.1.0
collector cli
root yes
